  "authoredNewGroupNames": [
    "conversion, completion/reopening and due dates persist without changing title/body/identity/notebook/tags",
    "already desired state is an explicit no-write/no-revision no-op but a stale no-op still rejects",
    "all malformed commands and unsupported transitions reject before persistence",
    "concurrent explicit completion commands accept one revision and reject the stale rival",
    "request primitives are frozen before a queued store read and cannot change command ownership",
    "failed atomic persistence preserves prior state and an explicit retry succeeds",
    "history restores captured to-do metadata as a fresh revision; earlier snapshots without this field retain current state",
    "JEX roundtrip carries edited local to-do fields and independent JSON copies retain validated state",
    "import-style metadata is read without normalization; changing type resets only due/completion fields",
    "all five app filters distinguish note/open/completed state and combine with existing text/tag/notebook/trash filters",
    "trashed, shared and locked note commands reject without changing saved bytes",
    "saved-note UI converts, completes, reopens, edits/clears due metadata and filters actual saved results",
    "unsaved drafts submit no to-do command and retain every typed field",
    "blank or invalid due inputs submit nothing; unchanged millisecond precision is retained",
    "actual committed held response blocks duplicate mutations and preserves a newer typed draft at the new revision",
    "selecting a new draft while a committed response is held keeps the new editor ownership",
    "disposing after actual commit suppresses every late read/publication without undoing saved state",
    "failed persistence restores enabled controls and supports a later explicit retry",
    "a held rejected write cannot publish its failure into a newer note editor generation",
    "typing after accepted state while list refresh is held retains the newer unsaved-draft status",
    "real HTTP cold restarts retain to-do transitions, history, due metadata and static browser module delivery",
    "editing imported to-do preserves exact resource bytes, IDs, relationships and unrelated JEX metadata over restart/export",
    "20 finite to-do field transitions match two authenticated released Joplin helpers with a fixed clock"
  ],
